or=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#1A1D26;fontSize=11.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="436" width="772" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b-40" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Courier New&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;script src&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; — The Executor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;download → &lt;b&gt;run&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;parser stops unless &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Courier New&quot;&gt;defer&lt;/span&gt; / &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Courier New&quot;&gt;async&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF6E7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#6B3A05;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="462" width="378" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b-41" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Courier New&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;link rel=&amp;quot;preload&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; — The Scout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;download → cache only, &lt;b&gt;never runs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;runs when a matching &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Courier New&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;script&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; appears" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E9FBF0;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0A4A25;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="418" y="462" width="378" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b-42" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Courier New&quot;&gt;preload&lt;/span&gt; fixes &lt;b&gt;discovery&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Courier New&quot;&gt;fetchpriority&lt;/span&gt; fixes &lt;b&gt;importance&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Courier New&quot;&gt;loading=&amp;quot;lazy&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt; fixes &lt;b&gt;waste&lt;/b&gt;. They combine: &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Courier New&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;link rel=&amp;quot;preload&amp;quot; as=&amp;quot;image&amp;quot; fetchpriority=&amp;quot;high&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; for the hero, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Courier New&quot;&gt;lazy&lt;/span&gt; for everything below the fold." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF6E7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#6B3A05;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="544" width="772" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>